      ],
      "parameters": {
        "height": 300,
        "width": 720,
        "content": "## TEMP - Which mailboxes are connected? (READ ONLY)\n\nFor every Gmail and Outlook credential used by our workflows, asks the mail service 'who am I?' (Gmail profile / the newest sent item (Outlook)). Nothing is read from or written to any mailbox. The last node lists, per credential: the real e-mail address, how many messages/threads the mailbox has (Gmail), and whether the connection still works. An error row means the credential is disconnected or expired (this is a likely cause of missing conversations).\n\nGroup 'conversation extraction' = the mailboxes the client-conversation workflows read (Email Intake Orchestrator, Client List Import, Gmail Processor / Outlook Processor). Delete this workflow when done."
      }
    },
